(CRITTER CAPTURE) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
T*
(The Master Plan) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
(THE SHORT VERSION) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(Critter Capture is a monster-catching role-playing game in the Game Boy) Tj
T*
(tradition, rebuilt to a modern standard and played in a browser on a tablet or) Tj
T*
(in a headset. It is not a small tribute. It is planned as a full-sized game with) Tj
T*
(a long tail: a region of roughly thirty-eight areas, one hundred or more) Tj
T*
(creatures, eight badge challenges and a league, spread across three chapters that) Tj
T*
(each ship as a complete game.) Tj
T*
T*
(The aim is not to be bigger than the games that inspired it. It is to be) Tj
T*
(distinctive, dense and premium - a game with one idea of its own that nobody) Tj
T*
(else in the genre has, and enough content to keep a player busy for years.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
(THE TARGETS AT FULL SIZE) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(Creatures - one hundred or more, across three chapters) Tj
T*
(Chapters - three, each a complete game in its own right) Tj
T*
(Badge challenges - eight, plus a final league gauntlet) Tj
T*
(Areas - about thirty-eight, from coast to mountain to tower) Tj
T*
(Field powers - five, each opening routes you could see but not reach) Tj
T*
(Types - twelve, on a chart of our own) Tj
T*
(Region - one, Rivenmoor, extended chapter by chapter) Tj
T*
(Post-game - a repeatable battle facility and leaderboards) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
