(THE REGION AT FULL SIZE) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(The region is Rivenmoor. The full journey runs in one long line that keeps) Tj
T*
(opening: a coastal home village, three towns in a wooded valley, a lake) Tj
T*
(crossing, a mining town, a mountain pass, a coastal city, and finally the league) Tj
T*
(tower.) Tj
T*
T*
(At full size the region holds about thirty-eight areas:) Tj
T*
T*
(- six towns) Tj
T*
(- three crossing routes) Tj
T*
(- two forests) Tj
T*
(- two cave systems) Tj
T*
(- a coast and a sea route) Tj
T*
(- a mountain) Tj
T*
(- a marsh) Tj
T*
(- a ruins) Tj
T*
(- the league approach and the league tower) Tj
T*
(- plus interiors: houses, shops, healing centres and challenge halls) Tj
T*
T*
(Each leg is gated by a badge or a field power, so progress is also permission.) Tj
T*
(You can see where you are not yet allowed to go, which is what makes exploring) Tj
T*
(feel like achievement rather than wandering.) Tj
T*
T*
(Time of day shifts the colour of the world and changes what appears in the) Tj
T*
(grass. Some creatures come out only at night; others only in rain. Weather) Tj
T*
(changes the light itself, not just an overlay on top of it.) Tj
T*
T*
/F2 13 Tf
(THE FIVE FIELD POWERS) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
T*
T*
(Field powers are the reason the map keeps opening. Each is earned from a) Tj
T*
(challenge, and each opens routes you could see but not reach before.) Tj
T*
T*
(1. Swim - cross open water) Tj
T*
(2. Shove - push boulders out of the way) Tj
T*
(3. Glow - light the dark caves) Tj
T*
(4. Glide - cross gaps and drop from ledges) Tj
T*
(5. Climb - scale rock walls) Tj
T*
T*
(Chapter One awards the first two. The rest arrive as the region grows.) Tj
ET
endstream
